@startuml product-zipper-operations
' One operational step of a focused dictionary/query product.
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #37474F
  FontColor #102027
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowThickness 2

title Product zipper operation — advance one reachable focus

rectangle "Product focus\n(snapshot, dictionary cursor, StateId)" as Focus #BBDEFB
rectangle "Inspect one real dictionary edge\nlabel a, child cursor" as Edge #C8E6C9
rectangle "Classify observation χ(a)" as Class #B2EBF2
rectangle "Lookup cached\n(StateId, χ(a))" as Cache #D1C4E9
rectangle "Observed transition?" as Observed #FFF9C4
rectangle "Generate reachable positions\nclose, normalize, exact-intern" as Generate #FFE0B2
rectangle "Live successor?" as Live #FFF9C4
rectangle "Child product focus\n(same snapshot, child cursor, next StateId)" as Child #DCEDC8
rectangle "Prune child subtree" as Prune #FFCDD2

Focus --> Edge
Edge --> Class
Class --> Cache
Cache --> Observed
Observed --> Live : yes / cached ID or dead
Observed --> Generate : no
Generate --> Cache : record exact result
Generate --> Live
Live --> Child : yes
Live --> Prune : no

note bottom of Child #E3F2FD
  Dictionary focus and query state
  always denote the same consumed path.
end note
@enduml
